(6314639, 935839, 124815, '<td valign="top">What a relief after hearts and chocolates! I quite like them, but at DPC I long for a different approach than the cards one might get at Hallmark. Now, on the subject at hand: Lupercalia was a festival observed in Feb. - a sort of cleansing ritual. Lupercus is god Pan - oh yes, still celebrated in Feb. So you beat around the Valentine''s bush! Clever. I would change the head of the shepherd though.</td>', 'What a relief after hearts and chocolates! I quite like them, but at DPC I long for a different approach than the cards one might get at Hallmark. Now, on the subject at hand: Lupercalia was a festival observed in Feb. - a sort of cleansing ritual. Lupercus is god Pan - oh yes, still celebrated in Feb. So you beat around the Valentine''s bush! Clever. I would change the head of the shepherd though.', '2011-02-15 08:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6314666, 935912, 7910, '<td valign="top">Clever.</td>', 'Clever.', '2011-02-15 09:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
