(6326303, 935897, 50283, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments everyone. Regarding the composition, it was vertical initially, but I extended the Black in post. I felt the model still had enough attention, and this way it thumbnails better.<br/> <br/>@tanguera: I''m not versed well enough in PS to uses tools like liquify, in fact I hadn''t even heard of it until your comment. The effect is achieved by shooting wide and up close.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments everyone. Regarding the composition, it was vertical initially, but I extended the Black in post. I felt the model still had enough attention, and this way it thumbnails better. @tanguera: I''m not versed well enough in PS to uses tools like liquify, in fact I hadn''t even heard of it until your comment. The effect is achieved by shooting wide and up close.', '2011-02-22 09:09:06.000000', NULL, 0),
